    "description": "<p>Once per rest, choose an ally within Far range and enhanced their defenses. When you do, place a <strong>d8</strong> on this card with the value 8 facing up. When you ally takes damage, they reduce it by the die's value. You then decrease the die's value by one. When the value reaches zero, this effect ends.</p><p>When your ally spends an <strong>Armor Slot</strong> to reduce the severity of the damage by one threshold, you can <strong>Spend a Stress</strong> to reduce it one step further. If the Armor Slot reduces the damage to the minor threshold, this effect would negate all Hit Point taken.</p>",
